@startuml
title UC-02 — Жизненный цикл диагностической сессии
hide empty description

[*] --> COLLECTING_EVIDENCE : create session
COLLECTING_EVIDENCE --> COLLECTING_EVIDENCE : add another recording / score
COLLECTING_EVIDENCE --> CLARIFYING : continue (questions required)
COLLECTING_EVIDENCE --> AWAITING_SUBMISSION : continue (no questions)
CLARIFYING --> AWAITING_SUBMISSION : answers saved / assign short exercise
AWAITING_SUBMISSION --> ASSESSING : submit attempt
ASSESSING --> REVIEW_READY : assessment available
ASSESSING --> AWAITING_SUBMISSION : failed/unusable data; retry or skip
REVIEW_READY --> AWAITING_SUBMISSION : retry / request another exercise
REVIEW_READY --> COMPLETED : learner confirms or accepts with notes
COMPLETED --> [*]

COLLECTING_EVIDENCE --> CANCELLED : cancel
CLARIFYING --> CANCELLED : cancel
AWAITING_SUBMISSION --> CANCELLED : cancel
REVIEW_READY --> CANCELLED : cancel
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of ASSESSING
MediaAsset processing has separate states.
An uncertain assessment is not a failure
and does not prove the skill is mastered.
end note

note bottom of COMPLETED
Finishing with remarks does not mark
skills as MASTERED.
end note
@enduml
